{"seq":5,"slug":"message-passing","title":"消息传递","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/message-passing","wordCount":1085,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"消息传递\">消息传递</h1><h2 id=\"问题描述\">问题描述</h2><p>并发编程的核心挑战之一是：多个执行单元如何安全地交换信息？传统方式通过共享内存通信，但这带来了竞态条件、死锁等一系列问题。<strong>消息传递（Message Passing）</strong> 提供了一种替代方案——并发实体之间不共享内存，而是通过发送和接收消息来交换数据。</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&quot;不要通过共享内存来通信，而是通过通信来共享内存。&quot;</p>\n</blockquote>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Shared Memory Approach&#10;        direction TB&#10;        T1[&quot;Thread A&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Read/Write&quot;| MEM[&quot;Shared Variable&lt;br/&gt;⚠️ Requires lock&quot;]&#10;        T2[&quot;Thread B&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Read/Write&quot;| MEM&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Message Passing Approach&#10;        direction TB&#10;        P1[&quot;Process A&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Send Message 📨&quot;| P2[&quot;Process B&quot;]&#10;        P2 --&gt;|&quot;Send Message 📨&quot;| P1&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Shared Memory Approach\n        direction TB\n        T1[\"Thread A\"] --&gt;|\"Read/Write\"| MEM[\"Shared Variable&lt;br/&gt;⚠️ Requires lock\"]\n        T2[\"Thread B\"] --&gt;|\"Read/Write\"| MEM\n    end\n    subgraph Message Passing Approach\n        direction TB\n        P1[\"Process A\"] --&gt;|\"Send Message 📨\"| P2[\"Process B\"]\n        P2 --&gt;|\"Send Message 📨\"| P1\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"消息传递的基本模型\">消息传递的基本模型</h3><p>消息传递是指并发实体之间通过发送（send）和接收（receive）消息来进行通信和同步，不涉及共享状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">要素</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>发送者</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">构造消息并发出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>接收者</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">接收并处理消息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>消息</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">承载数据的不可变载体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>通道/地址</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">消息的传输路径或目标标识</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"同步-vs-异步\">同步 vs 异步</h3><p>消息传递根据发送者是否等待接收者，分为两种模式：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant A as Sender&#10;    participant B as Receiver&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)&#10;        Note over A,B: Synchronous Message Passing&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;B: Send message&#10;        Note over A: Blocking wait...&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;B: Process message&#10;        B--&gt;&gt;A: Acknowledge receipt&#10;        Note over A: Continue execution&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)&#10;        Note over A,B: Asynchronous Message Passing&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;B: Send message (returns immediately)&#10;        Note over A: Continue with other work&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;B: Process message later&#10;    end\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant A as Sender\n    participant B as Receiver\n\n    rect rgb(220, 240, 255)\n        Note over A,B: Synchronous Message Passing\n        A-&gt;&gt;B: Send message\n        Note over A: Blocking wait...\n        B-&gt;&gt;B: Process message\n        B--&gt;&gt;A: Acknowledge receipt\n        Note over A: Continue execution\n    end\n\n    rect rgb(220, 255, 220)\n        Note over A,B: Asynchronous Message Passing\n        A-&gt;&gt;B: Send message (returns immediately)\n        Note over A: Continue with other work\n        B-&gt;&gt;B: Process message later\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">模式</th>\n<th align=\"left\">发送者行为</th>\n<th align=\"left\">优点</th>\n<th align=\"left\">缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>同步</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">阻塞直到接收者收到消息</td>\n<td align=\"left\">简单可靠，确认送达</td>\n<td align=\"left\">发送者被阻塞，吞吐量受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>异步</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">立即返回，不等待</td>\n<td align=\"left\">高吞吐，发送者不阻塞</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要缓冲区，可能消息丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"两大消息传递模型\">两大消息传递模型</h3><p>消息传递有两种主要的实现范式：<strong>CSP 模型</strong>（基于 Channel）和 <strong>Actor 模型</strong>（基于 Mailbox）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    MP[&quot;Message Passing Models&quot;] --&gt; CSP[&quot;📫 CSP Model&lt;br/&gt;Channel Communication&quot;]&#10;    MP --&gt; ACTOR[&quot;📬 Actor Model&lt;br/&gt;Mailbox Communication&quot;]&#10;    CSP --&gt; C1[&quot;Processes are anonymous&lt;br/&gt;Channels are first-class citizens&quot;]&#10;    CSP --&gt; C2[&quot;Communication via Channels&lt;br/&gt;Both parties must know the Channel&quot;]&#10;    ACTOR --&gt; A1[&quot;Actors have unique addresses&lt;br/&gt;Actors are first-class citizens&quot;]&#10;    ACTOR --&gt; A2[&quot;Communication via direct address&lt;br/&gt;Sender must know receiver&#39;s address&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    MP[\"Message Passing Models\"] --&gt; CSP[\"📫 CSP Model&lt;br/&gt;Channel Communication\"]\n    MP --&gt; ACTOR[\"📬 Actor Model&lt;br/&gt;Mailbox Communication\"]\n    CSP --&gt; C1[\"Processes are anonymous&lt;br/&gt;Channels are first-class citizens\"]\n    CSP --&gt; C2[\"Communication via Channels&lt;br/&gt;Both parties must know the Channel\"]\n    ACTOR --&gt; A1[\"Actors have unique addresses&lt;br/&gt;Actors are first-class citizens\"]\n    ACTOR --&gt; A2[\"Communication via direct address&lt;br/&gt;Sender must know receiver's address\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"典型场景\">典型场景</h2><h3 id=\"csp-模型-communicating-sequential-processes\">CSP 模型（Communicating Sequential Processes）</h3><p>在 CSP 模型中，并发实体（进程/协程）通过 <strong>Channel（通道）</strong> 进行通信。Channel 是独立的通信管道，发送者和接收者通过 Channel 解耦。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    P1[&quot;Process A&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Write&quot;| CH[&quot;📫 Channel&quot;]&#10;    CH --&gt;|&quot;Read&quot;| P2[&quot;Process B&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    P1[\"Process A\"] --&gt;|\"Write\"| CH[\"📫 Channel\"]\n    CH --&gt;|\"Read\"| P2[\"Process B\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// CSP 模型示例&#10;channel = 创建通道(缓冲区大小 = 0)    // 无缓冲通道 = 同步&#10;&#10;进程A:&#10;    data = 计算结果()&#10;    channel.发送(data)     // 阻塞直到进程B接收&#10;    打印 &quot;数据已发送&quot;&#10;&#10;进程B:&#10;    data = channel.接收()  // 阻塞直到进程A发送&#10;    处理(data)&#10;    打印 &quot;数据已处理&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// CSP 模型示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>channel = 创建通道(缓冲区大小 = 0)    // 无缓冲通道 = 同步</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>进程A:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = 计算结果()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    channel.发送(data)     // 阻塞直到进程B接收</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    打印 \"数据已发送\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>进程B:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data = channel.接收()  // 阻塞直到进程A发送</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    处理(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    打印 \"数据已处理\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Channel 的类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">类型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>无缓冲 Channel</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">容量为 0</td>\n<td align=\"left\">发送者和接收者必须同时就绪（同步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>有缓冲 Channel</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">容量为 N</td>\n<td align=\"left\">缓冲区未满时发送不阻塞（异步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>单向 Channel</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">只读或只写</td>\n<td align=\"left\">编译时保证通信方向</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"actor-模型\">Actor 模型</h3><p>在 Actor 模型中，每个 Actor 拥有自己的 <strong>Mailbox（邮箱）</strong>。发送者通过 Actor 的地址直接发送消息到其邮箱。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A1[&quot;Actor A&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;Send to B&#39;s address&quot;| MB[&quot;📬 B&#39;s Mailbox&quot;]&#10;    MB --&gt;|&quot;Process one by one&quot;| A2[&quot;Actor B&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A1[\"Actor A\"] --&gt;|\"Send to B's address\"| MB[\"📬 B's Mailbox\"]\n    MB --&gt;|\"Process one by one\"| A2[\"Actor B\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// Actor 模型示例&#10;WorkerActor:&#10;    私有状态 results = []&#10;&#10;    收到 &quot;compute(data)&quot; 消息:&#10;        result = 执行计算(data)&#10;        results.添加(result)&#10;        向 sender 回复 { type: &quot;done&quot;, result: result }&#10;&#10;    收到 &quot;get_results&quot; 消息:&#10;        向 sender 回复 { type: &quot;results&quot;, data: results }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Actor 模型示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WorkerActor:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    私有状态 results = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收到 \"compute(data)\" 消息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        result = 执行计算(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        results.添加(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        向 sender 回复 { type: \"done\", result: result }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    收到 \"get_results\" 消息:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        向 sender 回复 { type: \"results\", data: results }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"csp-vs-actor-详细对比\">CSP vs Actor 详细对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">对比维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">CSP 模型</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Actor 模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>通信媒介</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Channel（独立实体）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Mailbox（绑定到 Actor）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>标识方式</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Channel 有名字，进程匿名</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Actor 有唯一地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>耦合度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">通过 Channel 解耦</td>\n<td align=\"left\">发送者需知道 Actor 地址</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>同步支持</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">原生支持同步和异步</td>\n<td align=\"left\">本质是异步的</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>分布式支持</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">通常限于单进程</td>\n<td align=\"left\">天然支持跨节点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>缓冲区</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">可选（无缓冲 / 有缓冲）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">总是有（Mailbox）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>典型实现</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Go（goroutine + channel）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">Erlang/OTP、Akka</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>消息顺序</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">Channel 内 FIFO</td>\n<td align=\"left\">同一对发送者-接收者 FIFO</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"消息传递模式\">消息传递模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    PATTERN[&quot;Common Message Passing Patterns&quot;] --&gt; PP[&quot;Point-to-Point&lt;br/&gt;Point-to-Point&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; PS[&quot;Publish-Subscribe&lt;br/&gt;Pub/Sub&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; RR[&quot;Request-Reply&lt;br/&gt;Request/Reply&quot;]&#10;    PATTERN --&gt; FAN[&quot;Fan-out/Fan-in&lt;br/&gt;Fan-out/Fan-in&quot;]&#10;    PP --&gt; PP1[&quot;One sender → One receiver&quot;]&#10;    PS --&gt; PS1[&quot;One publisher → Multiple subscribers&quot;]&#10;    RR --&gt; RR1[&quot;Request → Wait for reply&quot;]&#10;    FAN --&gt; FAN1[&quot;One task → Split → Aggregate results&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    PATTERN[\"Common Message Passing Patterns\"] --&gt; PP[\"Point-to-Point&lt;br/&gt;Point-to-Point\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; PS[\"Publish-Subscribe&lt;br/&gt;Pub/Sub\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; RR[\"Request-Reply&lt;br/&gt;Request/Reply\"]\n    PATTERN --&gt; FAN[\"Fan-out/Fan-in&lt;br/&gt;Fan-out/Fan-in\"]\n    PP --&gt; PP1[\"One sender → One receiver\"]\n    PS --&gt; PS1[\"One publisher → Multiple subscribers\"]\n    RR --&gt; RR1[\"Request → Wait for reply\"]\n    FAN --&gt; FAN1[\"One task → Split → Aggregate results\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"解决方案\">解决方案</h2><h3 id=\"扇出-扇入模式\">扇出-扇入模式</h3><p>这是消息传递中常用的并发处理模式：将一个大任务拆分为多个子任务（扇出），各子任务并行处理后汇总结果（扇入）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SRC[&quot;📨 Task Source&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;Dispatcher&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;Subtask 1&quot;| W1[&quot;Worker 1&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;Subtask 2&quot;| W2[&quot;Worker 2&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|&quot;Subtask 3&quot;| W3[&quot;Worker 3&quot;]&#10;    W1 --&gt;|&quot;Result 1&quot;| AGG[&quot;Aggregator&quot;]&#10;    W2 --&gt;|&quot;Result 2&quot;| AGG&#10;    W3 --&gt;|&quot;Result 3&quot;| AGG&#10;    AGG --&gt; OUT[&quot;📊 Final Result&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    SRC[\"📨 Task Source\"] --&gt; D[\"Dispatcher\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"Subtask 1\"| W1[\"Worker 1\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"Subtask 2\"| W2[\"Worker 2\"]\n    D --&gt;|\"Subtask 3\"| W3[\"Worker 3\"]\n    W1 --&gt;|\"Result 1\"| AGG[\"Aggregator\"]\n    W2 --&gt;|\"Result 2\"| AGG\n    W3 --&gt;|\"Result 3\"| AGG\n    AGG --&gt; OUT[\"📊 Final Result\"]</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 扇出-扇入示例（CSP 风格）&#10;taskChannel = 创建通道()&#10;resultChannel = 创建通道()&#10;&#10;// 扇出：启动多个 Worker&#10;重复 3 次:&#10;    启动进程:&#10;        循环:&#10;            task = taskChannel.接收()&#10;            result = 处理(task)&#10;            resultChannel.发送(result)&#10;&#10;// 分发任务&#10;对于 tasks 中的每个 task:&#10;    taskChannel.发送(task)&#10;&#10;// 扇入：收集结果&#10;results = []&#10;重复 tasks.数量 次:&#10;    result = resultChannel.接收()&#10;    results.添加(result)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 扇出-扇入示例（CSP 风格）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>taskChannel = 创建通道()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resultChannel = 创建通道()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 扇出：启动多个 Worker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>重复 3 次:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    启动进程:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        循环:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            task = taskChannel.接收()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            result = 处理(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            resultChannel.发送(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 分发任务</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>对于 tasks 中的每个 task:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    taskChannel.发送(task)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 扇入：收集结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>results = []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>重复 tasks.数量 次:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = resultChannel.接收()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    results.添加(result)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"消息传递-vs-共享内存\">消息传递 vs 共享内存</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">对比维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">消息传递</th>\n<th align=\"left\">共享内存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>数据共享</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">不共享，通过消息复制</td>\n<td align=\"left\">直接共享内存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>同步机制</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">隐含在消息的发送/接收中</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要显式的锁和信号量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>竞态条件</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">天然避免</td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要程序员主动防范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">消息复制有开销</td>\n<td align=\"left\">直接访问更快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>编程复杂度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">较低（无锁）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较高（需要管理同步）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>分布式扩展</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">天然支持</td>\n<td align=\"left\">仅限单机</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>调试</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">较易（消息可追踪和记录）</td>\n<td align=\"left\">较难（竞态难以复现）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"typescript-风格的-channel-抽象\">TypeScript 风格的 Channel 抽象</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface Channel&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  send(value: T): Promise&lt;void&gt;;&#10;  receive(): Promise&lt;T&gt;;&#10;  close(): void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function createBufferedChannel&lt;T&gt;(capacity: number): Channel&lt;T&gt; {&#10;  const buffer: T[] = [];&#10;  const senders: Array&lt;{ value: T; resolve: () =&gt; void }&gt; = [];&#10;  const receivers: Array&lt;(value: T) =&gt; void&gt; = [];&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    async send(value: T) {&#10;      if (receivers.length &gt; 0) {&#10;        const recv = receivers.shift()!;&#10;        recv(value);&#10;      } else if (buffer.length &lt; capacity) {&#10;        buffer.push(value);&#10;      } else {&#10;        return new Promise&lt;void&gt;((resolve) =&gt; {&#10;          senders.push({ value, resolve });&#10;        });&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    async receive(): Promise&lt;T&gt; {&#10;      if (buffer.length &gt; 0) {&#10;        const value = buffer.shift()!;&#10;        if (senders.length &gt; 0) {&#10;          const s = senders.shift()!;&#10;          buffer.push(s.value);&#10;          s.resolve();&#10;        }&#10;        return value;&#10;      }&#10;      return new Promise&lt;T&gt;((resolve) =&gt; {&#10;        receivers.push(resolve);&#10;      });&#10;    },&#10;    close() {&#10;      senders.length = 0;&#10;      receivers.length = 0;&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-co