/span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      receivers.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>消息传递是并发编程中一种安全且优雅的通信范式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>核心思想</strong>：并发实体之间不共享内存，通过发送和接收消息交换数据</li>\n<li><strong>同步 vs 异步</strong>：同步消息传递保证送达但会阻塞发送者；异步消息传递不阻塞但需要缓冲</li>\n<li><strong>CSP 模型</strong>：以 Channel 为中心，进程通过 Channel 通信，适合单进程内的并发协调</li>\n<li><strong>Actor 模型</strong>：以 Actor 为中心，通过地址直接发送消息到 Mailbox，天然支持分布式</li>\n<li><strong>常见模式</strong>：点对点、发布-订阅、请求-响应、扇出-扇入等</li>\n<li>相比共享内存，消息传递天然避免竞态条件，更易于理解、调试和扩展到分布式环境</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"消息传递","id":"消息传递"},{"level":2,"text":"问题描述","id":"问题描述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"消息传递的基本模型","id":"消息传递的基本模型"},{"level":3,"text":"同步 vs 异步","id":"同步-vs-异步"},{"level":3,"text":"两大消息传递模型","id":"两大消息传递模型"},{"level":2,"text":"典型场景","id":"典型场景"},{"level":3,"text":"CSP 模型（Communicating Sequential Processes）","id":"csp-模型-communicating-sequential-processes"},{"level":3,"text":"Actor 模型","id":"actor-模型"},{"level":3,"text":"CSP vs Actor 详细对比","id":"csp-vs-actor-详细对比"},{"level":3,"text":"消息传递模式","id":"消息传递模式"},{"level":2,"text":"解决方案","id":"解决方案"},{"level":3,"text":"扇出-扇入模式","id":"扇出-扇入模式"},{"level":3,"text":"消息传递 vs 共享内存","id":"消息传递-vs-共享内存"},{"level":3,"text":"TypeScript 风格的 Channel 抽象","id":"typescript-风格的-channel-抽象"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"线程池与任务调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/supplementary/thread-pools"},"next":null}